# ── What is and is not committed under data/ ──────────────────────────────────
#
# Pipeline outputs ARE committed, so the app is clone-and-run with no API pull.
# The two exceptions are both re-fetchable and both large:
#
#   data/raw/media/   full-resolution federal renderings (~2 MB each, ~54 MB total).
#                     Stage 01 derives committed thumb/ and web/ variants from
#                     these; the originals are never read by the app.
#   data/raw/cache/   the polite-fetch HTTP cache. Scratch, by definition.
#
data/raw/media/
data/raw/cache/
